Appendix B: Rebuild Procedure
1.	Create an empty Supabase project (or any PostgreSQL server).
2.	In the SQL Editor run 001_schema.sql, then 002_seed.sql, then 003_remove_redundant_department.sql.
3.	In Authentication create the test logins (admin, hr, payroll and employee), then run supabase/tests/00_test_setup.sql to assign their roles.
4.	Copy .env.example to app/.env.local and enter the project URL and publishable key.
5.	In the app folder run npm install and npm run dev, then open http://localhost:3000.
